==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪm}}

===Etymology===
From {{AF.}} ''[[disclaimer]]'', from {{etyl|fro}} ''[[desclamer]]'' (French: ''[[déclamer]]''), ''[[des-]]'' "[[dis-]]" + ''[[clamer]]''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To renounce all claim to [[deny]]; ownership of, or responsibility for; to [[disown]]; to [[disavow]]; to [[reject]].
# To deny, as a claim; to [[refuse]].
# {{legal}} To [[relinquish]] or deny having a claim; to [[disavow]] another's claim; to [[decline]] accepting, as an estate, interest, or office.

====Synonyms====
* [[disown]]
* [[disavow]]
* [[renounce]]
* [[repudiate]]

====Derived terms====
* [[disclaimer]]

